1
00:00:00,565 --> 00:00:02,485
(Raj:)Wow.

2
00:00:03,234 --> 00:00:04,404
(Leonard:)No, it's great.

3
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:07,450
- Also, uh, mint-in-box.
- Mm.

4
00:00:07,655 --> 00:00:12,075
(Penny:)- And I got you a Transporter too!
- Awesome!

5
00:00:15,121 --> 00:00:18,711
(Sheldon:)Look, it was actually designed
for my vintage Mr. Spock action figure.

6
00:00:18,916 --> 00:00:20,916
(Penny:)Oh, that's great.
Open it and put him in there.

7
00:00:21,127 --> 00:00:22,877
- Open it?
- No, good Lord, no.

8
00:00:24,047 --> 00:00:25,177
Why? They're just toys.

9
00:00:25,381 --> 00:00:27,341
- Collectibles.
- They're mint-in-box.

10
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,130
Can't we open one up and take a look?

11
00:00:29,344 --> 00:00:31,174
- Aah!
- No, don't!

12
00:00:31,387 --> 00:00:34,477
(Leonard:)Once you open the box, it loses its value.

13
00:00:34,682 --> 00:00:38,732
(Penny:)Yeah, yeah. My mom gave me
the same lecture about my virginity.

14
00:00:40,772 --> 00:00:44,232
(Penny:)Gotta tell you, it was a lot more fun
taking it out and playing with it.

15
00:00:47,111 --> 00:00:49,531
(Bernadette:)You sure you want us here
when you meet this woman?

16
00:00:49,739 --> 00:00:54,019
Oh, yes. Ln my cuIture, it's expected to
have a chaperone to oversee a first date.

